==English==

===Etymology===
Attested since about 1790, from {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{m|la|centenarius||of one hundred}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|centeni||one hundred each}} (from {{m|la|centum||hundred}} + {{m|la|-arius}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of, pertaining to, or completing a period of 100 years.

